    "Spell.dbc gave 283064 and its stack aura 283066 ProcFlags 0x10, so melee-class spells such as Sinister Strike built the stacks and no Fireball counted or paid off.",
    "Each Fireball cast in combat adds one 283066 stack; at two stacks Carbon Buildup is applied. The third Fireball fires three 283069 and removes both auras."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
